# 한글: 접촉 파지 Action (prd/arm-control-path.md R5). goal은 프로파일 이름 하나. 서보는 힘을 알려 주지 않으므로 결과의
#       성공은 "접촉을 찾고 조임이 2 s 유지됨"을 뜻하며 파지력(N)을 보증하지 않는다. 성공해도 그리퍼 소유권은 HOLDING으로 유지되고
#       Release 서비스로만 반환된다.
# Contact grasp action. The goal is just a profile name. The servo reports no force: success means "a contact was found and the
# squeeze held still for 2 s", not a grip force in newtons. After a success the gripper stays owned (HOLDING) until Release.

# --- goal ---
string profile          # "cube3cm" (the only validated profile; +16 squeeze is NOT a default for other objects)
---
# --- result ---
bool success
string reason           # "" on success, else the failure reason (TempHigh, NoContact, OutsideWindow, NoReading, Timeout, ...)
int32 contact_position  # gripper pulses where the jaws were blocked, -1 if none
int32 final_position    # gripper pulses when the action ended, -1 if unknown
---
# --- feedback ---
string state            # Check, Closing, Squeeze, Holding, ...
int32 gripper_position  # latest reading, -1 if none
int32 contact_position  # -1 until found
float32 temperature_c   # latest gripper servo temperature, -1.0 if none
float32 elapsed_s
string note
